  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "1303201",
      "subQuestName": "和兰浮婆一起前往无郁稠林",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "130320101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "130320101": {
            "id": "130320101",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "我刚刚就想问了，准备是什么？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130320102"
            ]
          },
          "130320102": {
            "id": "130320102",
            "speakerId": 13303,
            "speakerName": "兰浮婆",
            "text": "那菈艾文还没有完全想起来，回忆与梦想，都不可或缺。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130320103"
            ]
          },
          "130320103": {
            "id": "130320103",
            "speakerId": 13261,
            "speakerName": "艾文",
            "text": "梦想…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130320104"
            ]
          },
          "130320104": {
            "id": "130320104",
            "speakerId": 13261,
            "speakerName": "艾文",
            "text": "可是我，再也站不起来了。就算是恢复，也不知道能不能好，需要多久。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130320105"
            ]
          },
          "130320105": {
            "id": "130320105",
            "speakerId": 13303,
            "speakerName": "兰浮婆",
            "text": "不需要有这样的担心。那菈艾文要记住，梦想关联的是你的心，而不是身体。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130320106"
            ]
          },
          "130320106": {
            "id": "130320106",
            "speakerId": 13261,
            "speakerName": "艾文",
            "text": "心…？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130320107"
            ]
          },
          "130320107": {
            "id": "130320107",
            "speakerId": 13303,
            "speakerName": "兰浮婆",
            "text": "老身就送到这里了。宝贵的东西，就靠那菈艾文自己去找回来吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130320108"
            ]
          },
          "130320108": {
            "id": "130320108",
            "speakerId": 1035,
            "speakerName": "宵宫",
            "text": "欸？他就这样不见了？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130320109"
            ]
          },
          "130320109": {
            "id": "130320109",
            "speakerId": 1035,
            "speakerName": "宵宫",
            "text": "周围的天色，好像也有点改变了的样子。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130320110"
            ]
          },
          "130320110": {
            "id": "130320110",
            "speakerId": 13261,
            "speakerName": "艾文",
            "text": "心…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130320111"
            ]
          },
          "130320111": {
            "id": "130320111",
            "speakerId": 13261,
            "speakerName": "艾文",
            "text": "……！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130320112"
            ]
          },
          "130320112": {
            "id": "130320112",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "欸——？！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130320113"
            ]
          },
          "130320113": {
            "id": "130320113",
            "speakerId": 13261,
            "speakerName": "艾文",
            "text": "我…站起来了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130320114"
            ]
          },
          "130320114": {
            "id": "130320114",
            "speakerId": 13261,
            "speakerName": "艾文",
            "text": "毫不费力，也没有奇怪的感觉，一切都和生病之前一样。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130320115"
            ]
          },
          "130320115": {
            "id": "130320115",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "喂，难道说我们…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130320116"
            ]
          },
          "130320116": {
            "id": "130320116",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "进入梦里了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130320117"
            ]
          },
          "130320117": {
            "id": "130320117",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "嗯，之前也有过这种事，怪不得他说不需要担心，在梦里艾文就是可以自由活动的。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130320118"
            ]
          },
          "130320118": {
            "id": "130320118",
            "speakerId": 13261,
            "speakerName": "艾文",
            "text": "你们看，我站起来了！嘿嘿，我站起来了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130320119"
            ]
          },
          "130320119": {
            "id": "130320119",
            "speakerId": 1035,
            "speakerName": "宵宫",
            "text": "那不是太好了嘛，这样我们就能一起去找兰莎妮了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130320120"
            ]
          },
          "130320120": {
            "id": "130320120",
            "speakerId": 1035,
            "speakerName": "宵宫",
            "text": "我们来赛跑吧，正好也让我看看你究竟有多么厉害。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130320121"
            ]
          },
          "130320121": {
            "id": "130320121",
            "speakerId": 13261,
            "speakerName": "艾文",
            "text": "我可能还没恢复好…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130320122"
            ]
          },
          "130320122": {
            "id": "130320122",
            "speakerId": 13261,
            "speakerName": "艾文",
            "text": "算了，不管了，来跑吧！就算是大人我也完全不害怕！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130320123"
            ]
          },
          "130320123": {
            "id": "130320123",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "啊，跑出去了！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130320124"
            ]
          },
          "130320124": {
            "id": "130320124",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "没想到这么顺利，还以为她需要再适应适应呢。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130320127"
            ]
          },
          "130320127": {
            "id": "130320127",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "嘿嘿，是啊，我们也追上去吧。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1303202",
      "subQuestName": "追上跑开的艾文",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "130320201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "130320201": {
            "id": "130320201",
            "speakerId": 13261,
            "speakerName": "艾文",
            "text": "哈啊，哈啊，还是姐姐比较厉害…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130320202"
            ]
          },
          "130320202": {
            "id": "130320202",
            "speakerId": 1035,
            "speakerName": "宵宫",
            "text": "嘿嘿，距离长一点还真不好说，我还以为我会被追上呢。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130320203"
            ]
          },
          "130320203": {
            "id": "130320203",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "艾文好像完全不落下风。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130320204"
            ]
          },
          "130320204": {
            "id": "130320204",
            "speakerId": 13261,
            "speakerName": "艾文",
            "text": "我以前也跑赢过很多大人，腿长可不一定跑得就快，锻炼也很重要。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130320205"
            ]
          },
          "130320205": {
            "id": "130320205",
            "speakerId": 1035,
            "speakerName": "宵宫",
            "text": "再过几年，我就不是对手啦，哈哈哈。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130320206"
            ]
          },
          "130320206": {
            "id": "130320206",
            "speakerId": 1035,
            "speakerName": "宵宫",
            "text": "唔，我看看，接下来应该往哪个方向走呢…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130320207"
            ]
          },
          "130320207": {
            "id": "130320207",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "欸，快看，前面好像有个东西飘起来了！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130320208"
            ]
          },
          "130320208": {
            "id": "130320208",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "像是…星星？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130320209"
            ]
          },
          "130320209": {
            "id": "130320209",
            "speakerId": 13261,
            "speakerName": "艾文",
            "text": "难道是让我们跟上去吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "130320210"
            ]
          },
          "130320210": {
            "id": "130320210",
            "speakerId": 1035,
            "speakerName": "宵宫",
            "text": "嗯，有可能，跟上去看看。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1303203",
